 1、1 * 5 = 5。複合代入は左から順に適用される。 a += b は (T)(a + b) 相当の暗黙キャストを含む（JLS §15.26.2）。byte b = 1; b += 1; は暗黙キャストが含まれるため通るが、b = b + 1; は右辺が int のためコンパイルエラーになる。オーバーフローも暗黙に起き得る。","reasoningSteps":["7 % 3 = 1、1 * 5 = 5。","複合代入は左から順に適用される。","a += b は (T)(a + b) 相当の暗黙キャストを含む（JLS §15.26.2）。","byte b = 1; b += 1; は暗黙キャストが含まれるため通るが、b = b + 1; は右辺が int のためコンパイルエラーになる。","オーバーフローも暗黙に起き得る。"],"wrongReasons":[{"optionId":"a","reason":"%= が効いていない。"},{"optionId":"c","reason":"*= が効いていない。"},{"optionId":"d","reason":"= の右辺の値のまま。"}],"boundaries":[],"alternativeCriteria":[],"references":[{"title":"Java言語仕様","url":"https://docs.oracle.com/javase/specs/jls/se21/html/index.html"}]},"hints":[{"id":"h1","text":"7 % 3 はいくつ？","revealsAnswer":false},{"id":"h2","text":"その値に 5 を掛ける。","revealsAnswer":false},{"id":"h3","text":"順序を入れ替えると変わるか。","revealsAnswer":false}],"writingRequired":false,"tests":[],"runnerProfile":null,"relatedIds":[],"transferIds":[],"evidence":{"specReviewed":false,"compilerRun":{"tool":"javac/java","version":"javac 21.0.13","sourceSha256":"ae68000ca517b1c44311b284e67b8a1f7a7543e2398c5fb0124b511b7521db81","status":"passed","stdout":["5"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-28"},"browserRun":null},"legacyRefs":[],"extensions":{"importedFrom":"01","sourceId":"J0144","verificationScope":"表示コードをラッパー込みで実行し、標準出力を独立照合。解説全文の人手校閲を意味しません。"}},{"id":"java:q20145","language":"java","contentVersion":"independent-20261028","unitId":"java:arena01-J-U15","order":145,"level":"beginner","kind":"choice","title":"論理演算と短絡評価：処理を追う","prompt":"論理演算と短絡評価：処理を追う：出力はどれ？ コードの結果として正しいものを選んでください。","conceptIds":["java:arena01-j-short-circuit","java:arena01-j-order-of-operations"],"prerequisiteConceptIds":["java:arena01-j-boolean-compare","java:arena01-j-order-of-operations","java:arena01-j-primitive"],"introducesConceptIds":[],"setup":{"files":[{"path":"Main.java","content":"int n = 0;\nboolean r = false && (++n > 0);\nSystem.out.println(n + \" \" + r);","editable":false}],"entryPoint":"Main.main","languageVersion":"Java 21","editio